# Loaded by archon (v0.10.1 loadArchonEnv: "<cwd>/.archon/.env", repo scope,
# overrides ~/.archon/.env) for every run, resume and approve started from the
# Goodword root, and inherited by every Claude node subprocess.
#
# Background tasks off: a Claude node that backgrounds its sub-agents ends its
# turn, archon waits on the live tasks, then records the node COMPLETED with its
# artifacts unwritten (run f07acb10: ralplan -> SNAPSHOT=FAIL no plan.md). With
# this set, run_in_background is not in the tool schema and sub-agents block the
# turn, so outputs are written before the node ends. Codex nodes ignore it.
CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_BACKGROUND_TASKS=1
